{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43512","headline":"鹤鸣九臯 · 无名氏","name":"鹤鸣九臯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胎化呈仙质，长鸣在九臯。\n排空散清唳，映日委霜毛。\n万里思寥廓，千山望郁陶。\n香凝光不见，风积韵弥高。\n凤侣攀何及，鸡羣思忽劳。\n昇天如有应，飞舞出蓬蒿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43512.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43512","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}